### Get all users
GET {{url}}/user?status=0
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json


###


### Get all users
GET {{url}}/user/search/records
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json


###


### Get a specific user by ID
GET {{url}}/user/1
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json


###


### Create a new user
POST {{url}}/user
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Omn Shinde",
  "username": "omnath3",
  "password": "12345",
  "employeeId": "2236",
  "roleId": 2,
  "siteId": null
}


