### Update a user
PUT {{url}}/user/47
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "omnath12",
  "password": "12345",
  "siteId": 1
}


###


### Delete a user
DELETE {{url}}/user/
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json


###


